data.get-v1accountingstats#GET /v1/accounting:
Returns local accounting statistics for this node.
curl --digest -u ":$DRL_PRIVATE_API_KEY" http://localhost:8082/v1/accounting/stats Response:
{ "local_node_id": "drl-1", "monitored_entities_count": 1234, "batched_updates_pending": 17, "estimated_entities_count": 1200 }

data.get-v1status#GET /v1/status:
Returns cluster membership information for this node.
curl --digest -u ":$DRL_PRIVATE_API_KEY" http://localhost:8082/v1/status Response:
{ "cluster_name": "drl", "node_id": "drl-1", "active_peers": ["drl-1", "drl-2", "drl-3"], "active_peer_addresses": ["10.0.0.2:8082", "10.0.0.3:8082"], "uptime": "2h30m15s", "uptime_seconds": 9015.5 }

data.get-v1uiget-token#GET /v1/ui/get-token:
Issues a short-lived (10-minute) bootstrap token for initiating the ECDH key exchange. Requires Digest authentication.
curl --digest -u "admin:$DRL_PRIVATE_API_KEY" http://localhost:8082/v1/ui/get-token Response:
{ "bootstrap_token": "eyJ..." }
